WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.580
A tall tree on level ground.

2
00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.520
Far too tall to measure from the bottom.

3
00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.800
All you have is a tape
measure and a protractor.

4
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:13.880
You walk some way from the trunk,
stop, and look up at the very top.

5
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.200
Can one distance and one
angle give you the height?

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.750
Or must you climb?

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.640
In this mission, you'll spot the
right-angled triangle made by the tree,

8
00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.210
the ground and your line of sight.

9
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:27.860
You'll name its sides
from the angle you know:

10
00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.890
opposite, adjacent and hypotenuse.

11
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:34.700
You'll use the angle of elevation,
measured up from the horizontal,

12
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.400
and see how tangent connects
opposite and adjacent.

13
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:43.150
Your mission: work out how to find a
tree's height with just a protractor and

14
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:43.890
a tape.
